      "thinkers": "Hilary Putnam (\"Brains and Behaviour\", 1963)",
      "question": "In \"Brains and Behaviour\" (1963), Hilary Putnam formulated the famous thought experiment of the **\"Super-Spartans\"** (and the subsequent **\"X-citizens\"**) to decisively dismantle Logical Behaviorism (Ryle, Hempel, Carnap). Why do the Super-Spartans expose a fatal flaw in the behaviorist definition of mental states?",
